00:03:15.629 --> 00:03:20.467 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Bleu, orange, rouge ou vert,

00:03:16.697 --> 00:03:21.468 size:53% position:73% line:53%
il faudra attendre le 2 juin

00:03:17.698 --> 00:03:21.902 size:53% position:73% line:53%
